Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the fastest way to fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.12,0:00:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure your parents will be happy\Nthat tonight's dinner is taken care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.72,0:00:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't control my strength, so\NI'm always breaking stuff at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.82,0:00:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And because of that, Mom and Dad get so\Nembarrassed that they can't help but laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.94,0:00:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you gotta look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.02,0:00:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise you can't choose a product.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.22,0:00:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What product?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did this big, medley box come from?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.66,0:01:14.05,sign_29945_459_Oden,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs30\c&HF5BEEF&\3c&H8E2FBD&}Oden
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For some reason, it feels familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.00,0:01:13.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something tells me that this box\Nis friendly and kind-hearted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.36,0:01:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, this magic item saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.84,0:01:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a precious friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.38,0:01:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.36,0:01:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please take me with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.08,0:01:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't leave me all alone again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.32,0:01:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After you got abducted, she was so\Nfrantic she didn't even stop to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.96,0:01:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think this might have\Nreminded her of an old incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.30,0:01:36.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old incident?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.92,0:01:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's probably alright\Nfor me to tell you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.54,0:01:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, years ago our village was\Nwiped out during a monster attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.30,0:01:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.00,0:01:49.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas and I were among the few survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.60,0:01:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both of our parents ended up dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.98,0:01:56.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas had her blessing then,\Nbut she was too scared to act.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.84,0:02:01.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why, to this day, she blames herself\Nfor not being able to save everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.96,0:02:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember she used to be too\Nafraid to even kill the tiniest bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.32,0:02:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now she's become a\Nhunter of all things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.46,0:02:13.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no idea she went through all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.22,0:02:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there's anything that I can do\Nto help her out, I have to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.00,0:02:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Boxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.90,0:02:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Promise me, we'll always be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.40,0:02:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.88,0:02:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be here for as\Nlong as you'll have me.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.19,0:03:00.53,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine, {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.28,0:02:59.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,believe
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.65,0:03:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.57,0:03:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your memory, and you\Ncan't find a special moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.48,0:03:18.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but in the meantime, there are\Nno friends we haven't seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.39,0:03:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's amazing how I can see\Nit, and why are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.50,0:03:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's amazing that I can't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.80,0:03:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still waiting for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.54,0:03:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.55,0:04:03.47,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(98,55)\fad(734,1)\fsp.8}Vanity, Pride, and Vending Machine
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.54,0:04:06.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've decided to stay in this\Nvillage for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.98,0:04:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like we'll be neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.98,0:04:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.44,0:04:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you have any questions about how\Nthings work here, feel free to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.46,0:04:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, I'll be counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.42,0:04:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, Director Bear asked me to help\Nwith some more reconstruction around town.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.28,0:04:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you later. No\Nproblem. Have fun, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.22,0:04:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Hulemy, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.86,0:04:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, we need a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.96,0:04:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't these guys Suori's bodyguards?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.38,0:04:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.98,0:04:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Later today, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.02,0:04:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suori intends to approach the two\Nof you with a personal request.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.28,0:04:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd like to ask that you hear\Nwhat she has to say and then agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.74,0:04:46.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.72,0:04:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want us to say yes before we\Neven know what she's asking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.90,0:04:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean she's already nearby?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.24,0:04:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please keep our conversation a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.90,0:04:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'd skin us alive if she\Nfound out we were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.14,0:05:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.64,0:05:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.28,0:05:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you the famous magic\Nitem engineer, Hulemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.56,0:05:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I didn't mean to interrupt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.80,0:05:12.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that would be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.58,0:05:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.08,0:05:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.99,0:05:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, my name is Suori.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.90,0:05:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive my rudeness, but I have\Na matter I need your help dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.20,0:05:23.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.18,0:05:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to do\Nstuff like that, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.72,0:05:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough with the bowing. Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.34,0:05:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean you'll accept my request?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.36,0:05:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't say that, but if you\Ntell me more, I will consider it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.10,0:05:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very soon, there's going to\Nbe an important gathering.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.48,0:05:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Influential merchant\Nfamilies will be showing off
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.48,0:05:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their magic items and\Nengineers and their employee.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.16,0:05:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, that explains why you\Nhad your eye on me and Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.30,0:05:48.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.21,0:05:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know the girl who planned the event.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.30,0:05:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her name is Kanashi, and she's from a\Nrival merchant family with ties to my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.98,0:05:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just the thought of her annoying\Nface is enough to make me scream!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.50,0:06:04.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess even rich people\Nhave their problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.92,0:06:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it sounds fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.72,0:06:08.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could get down to party.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.58,0:06:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Boxxo? Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.68,0:06:13.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that decides it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.54,0:06:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.76,0:06:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have a clear view back there, Boxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.44,0:06:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.98,0:06:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, where's this girl Suori\Nhas such a huge grudge against?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.26,0:06:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the sounds of it, they\Nshould be close in age.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.50,0:06:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, there she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.86,0:06:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In terms of who pulls off the\Nrich girl look, she might win out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.64,0:06:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Kanashi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.02,0:06:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been far too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.38,0:06:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How nice to see you, Miss Suwori.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.84,0:06:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't feel any\Nneed to put yourself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.30,0:06:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might be best if\Nyou take your seat now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.80,0:06:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That way you'll have the perfect view\Nfrom which to watch the proceedings.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.90,0:06:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You needn't try so hard\Nyourself, Miss Kanashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.94,0:06:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid my conscience\Nwouldn't be able to handle it
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.54,0:07:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if your little black heart\Nwere to give up from shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.18,0:07:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.28,0:07:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't aware you even had a conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.42,0:07:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems your hearing is as\Nawful as your personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.66,0:07:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I pity you, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.86,0:07:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is way too mean to be\Na conversation between kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.82,0:07:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This person behind you, I'm guessing\Nshe's your magic item engineer?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.40,0:07:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yup, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.02,0:07:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, she's the best around!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.52,0:07:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever engineer you hired\Ncan't hold a candle to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.72,0:07:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, I'll let you keep up your\Nconfident facade while you still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.40,0:07:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll only make the sight of your\Nmiserable frustration all the sweeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.34,0:07:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She makes me so mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.10,0:07:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.64,0:07:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry you had to\Nsee all that ugliness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.68,0:07:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, it was actually pretty fun to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.24,0:07:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.18,0:07:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attention, ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.10,0:07:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We welcome you to this year's event.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.00,0:08:00.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will now begin the\Nunveiling festivities.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.70,0:08:01.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our first participant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.08,0:08:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you would be so kind, what sort of\Nmagic item did you bring to show us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.04,0:08:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This magic item can transform\Ninto a wide variety of weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.28,0:08:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I theorized a similar concept\Nonce. This should be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.60,0:08:18.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.90,0:08:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.36,0:08:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With this magic item's special ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.22,0:08:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you no longer have to carry\Na ton of different weapons?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.42,0:08:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,around with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.66,0:08:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that reaction makes sense. Voila!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.80,0:08:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it our turn yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.22,0:08:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to get this over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.94,0:08:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the moment you've\Nall been waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.48,0:08:52.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will now unveil Miss\NKanashi's magic item.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.24,0:08:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We hope you enjoy the spectacle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.62,0:09:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm excited to show you the magic\Nitem my engineer brought along.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.66,0:09:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feast your eyes on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.38,0:09:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see what you're so proud of.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.86,0:09:09.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eh, whatever it is, I\Ndoubt it's anything good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.38,0:09:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This unique magic item was produced based\Non the physiology of a certain monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.26,0:09:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold, it will obey any command I give.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.60,0:09:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that impossible?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.90,0:09:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.78,0:09:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To create an intelligent magic item has\Nlong been a dream for all engineers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.52,0:09:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, I have accomplished\Nthis nigh impossible feat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.34,0:09:42.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.60,0:09:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember what I said\Nwhen we got kidnapped?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.70,0:09:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With our current technology, there's no\Nway to give a magic item intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.06,0:09:49.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.34,0:09:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you put a person's soul\Ninside, it's not out of the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.08,0:09:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though doing so is extremely\Ndangerous and was declared
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.02,0:10:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,illegal by the Magic Item\NEngineers Association.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.38,0:10:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once, a foolish engineer\Nthought he was above this rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.62,0:10:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And his hubris destroyed an entire town.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.96,0:10:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean we're in danger here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.88,0:10:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, tell me, have you seen anything as\Nmarvelous as this magic item before?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.96,0:10:19.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know who this year's winner will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.36,0:10:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.26,0:10:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.38,0:10:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never mentioned it was\Ncapable of human speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.50,0:10:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit, I was afraid something\Nlike this would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.38,0:10:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.12,0:10:35.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.03,0:10:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.56,0:10:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't equip it with a speech function!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.24,0:10:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to shut it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.82,0:10:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is you who helped me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.20,0:10:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you wake me from my slumber!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.54,0:10:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.84,0:10:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He forced a human soul inside\Nof that magic puppet! Hey, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.78,0:10:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.32,0:10:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! Shades!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.02,0:11:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you hold that thing down? Ma 'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.18,0:11:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.82,0:11:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's the magic seal\Nkeeping the soul in place!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.44,0:11:18.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They even put a brainwashing spell on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.22,0:11:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have some respect for the dead, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.22,0:11:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.16,0:11:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.52,0:11:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must have been torture.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.48,0:11:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.90,0:11:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were forced out of your slumber.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.28,0:11:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something like this shouldn't\Nhave happened to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.04,0:11:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise your rest won't\Nbe disrupted again. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.04,0:11:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can this be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.50,0:11:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I devoted years to\Ncreating that technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.58,0:11:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was supposed to be\Nmy life's greatest work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.04,0:11:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you deactivate it so quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.60,0:11:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You call that crude bit of\Nengineering your life's work?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.94,0:11:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.28,0:12:03.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With Hulemy on the case, that was easier\Nthan squishing a frog fiend tadpole.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.94,0:12:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Hulemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.18,0:12:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't mean the girl\Nwonder of mayhem, Hulemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.94,0:12:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wasn't she the problem child\Nat the center of all those
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.70,0:12:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,explosions and fires at the\Nschool of magic item engineers?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.74,0:12:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One time she made a sleeping potion so\Nstrong she put the whole school to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.66,0:12:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She made a water purifying drug,\Nbut when she put it in a pond,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.16,0:12:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it ended up vaporizing the\Nwater instead of purifying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.26,0:12:24.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You jerks!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.17,0:12:26.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't you let that\Nall stay in the past?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.42,0:12:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's such a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.74,0:12:32.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like your magic item\Nengineer just wasn't good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.82,0:12:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh brother, things got a\Nlittle hairy for a moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.82,0:12:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but everything turned\Nout all right in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.00,0:12:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you ask me, this\Ncounts as a job well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.62,0:12:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I do have one minor complaint.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.46,0:12:48.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get the feeling that everyone's\Ntotally forgotten about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.42,0:12:53.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lately, it started snowing in the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.36,0:12:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems that Winter has finally\Ncome to the Clear Flow Lake Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.76,0:13:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, thank you for\Ngathering here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.98,0:13:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never would have imagined their\Nreach would extend this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.42,0:13:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess we got too complacent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.62,0:13:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've taken control of 70 % of\Nthe strata they've been released in,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.12,0:13:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and now they've set their sights\Non the Clear Flow Lake Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.06,0:13:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to mount a counterattack,\Notherwise we'll be ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.18,0:13:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must set aside our\Ndifferences and come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.70,0:13:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will join hands in order to eliminate\Nthe worst threat we've ever faced,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.98,0:13:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chains Restaurant! Hear, hear!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.06,0:13:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, our\Nbusinesses will go under.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.34,0:13:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather die than lose my shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.02,0:13:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've taken the liberty to invite a\Ncertain someone to be our secret weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.94,0:13:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you mind saying hello\Nto the group? Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.26,0:13:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for joining us today, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.58,0:13:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Based on everything I've gathered so far,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.10,0:13:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it seems a big-time restaurant chain has\Nset its sights on our little village.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.48,0:13:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This chain's restaurant poses an\Nexistential threat to local businesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.14,0:13:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.22,0:14:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been driven into a corner and\Nwe're running out of options here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.54,0:14:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn that greedy chain's restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.92,0:14:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, I won't be\Nable to feed my children.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.58,0:14:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to\Nsurvive through the winter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.62,0:14:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know why they invited me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.34,0:14:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As ridiculous as it sounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.00,0:14:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're expecting a\Nvending machine to figure
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.80,0:14:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out a way to get them\Nout of this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.20,0:14:22.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Boxo, would you be willing to\Nlend us a hand through this crisis?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.84,0:14:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you agree to help,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.34,0:14:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise to let Llamas\Nstay at the end for
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.46,0:14:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,half price once it's back up and running.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.42,0:14:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it'll help Llamas out,\Nthere's no way I'll refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.66,0:14:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.88,0:14:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.26,0:14:40.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad everyone's excited, but\Nwe're not out of the woods yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.36,0:14:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, I guess I better get\NLlamas and Hume on board too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.90,0:14:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.81,0:14:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come one, come all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.04,0:14:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you're craving, we have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.10,0:14:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We here at Chains Restaurants are proud\Nto offer delicious food at a great price!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.50,0:14:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is super busy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.32,0:14:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd heard stories about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.84,0:15:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's all the more impressive\Ngetting to see it up close like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.24,0:15:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get why Munami and the\Nothers are concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.76,0:15:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys aren't here to\Ngather intel, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.62,0:15:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.08,0:15:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you sniff us out so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.20,0:15:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think it might be\Nthe big box on your back?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.06,0:15:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be the intelligent magic\Nitem I've heard so much about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.06,0:15:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you ever consider coming\Nover and working for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.70,0:15:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise you'll be treated well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.62,0:15:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way Boxo would want\Nto work at a place like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.96,0:15:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, he said he'd always stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.10,0:15:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.68,0:15:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.34,0:15:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See? Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.96,0:15:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured you might say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.06,0:15:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.08,0:15:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In a few months, we'll be\Nraking in the coins anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.06,0:15:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we're pretty busy\Nalready, so excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.32,0:15:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fine i guess tastes pretty\Nmuch like i imagined i'd say it's
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.36,0:15:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,average at best i wonder if maybe\Nit's because i'm too used to boxo's
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.36,0:16:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,food but the stuff they serve here\Ndoesn't even come close to impressing
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.94,0:16:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me same for me feels like their\Nflavors are weak that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.56,0:16:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this world, seasonings aren't\Ncheap, so things tend to taste plain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.64,0:16:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just thought of a way to beat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.96,0:16:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.44,0:16:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I now call the second Chains Restaurant\NAnnihilation meeting to order.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.58,0:16:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our only chance to beat them is right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.10,0:16:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,while Chains is holding\Ntheir opening sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.40,0:16:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To prevent our customers\Nfrom being lured away,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.12,0:16:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll convince them to stay by\Nappealing to their stomachs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.16,0:16:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the first step in our plan, we'll\Nhave to develop a brand new menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.34,0:16:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So did everyone bring their trial\Ndishes? It's good to see them so excited?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.80,0:16:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there so Boxo I'd love to hear\Nwhatever feedback you have about my
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.58,0:16:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,new trial dish how exactly do you want\Nme to do that actually I don't know if
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.08,0:16:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo can even taste the food how about\Nyou let me and Hula me try it we'll
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.96,0:17:03.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tell you what we think that sounds\Ngood to me why don't you help yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.16,0:17:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's good but I think you could make\Nthe flavor just a little bit stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.28,0:17:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And maybe the sauce could be thicker?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.46,0:17:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That way it would stick\Nto the pasta better.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.92,0:17:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.83,0:17:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you could let the pasta absorb more of the\Nsoup when cooking to impart more flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.72,0:17:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice job!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.78,0:17:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's some great advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.92,0:17:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta write that down. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.56,0:17:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, what is this, Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.36,0:17:36.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.27,0:17:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.34,0:17:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's very well seasoned\Nand the sauce is thick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.92,0:17:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It tastes like it's made from milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.30,0:17:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can use this as a\Nreference to improve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.38,0:17:45.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.38,0:17:46.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She figured out what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.32,0:17:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.50,0:17:49.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waxo, teach me your ways!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.24,0:17:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, share your wisdom with us!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:51.80,0:17:52.76,sign_29945_459_Oden,text,0,0,0,,{\c&H6A6A6A&\3c&HE8F2FF&\bord2\fs30\i0}Deep-Fried {\i1}Chicken
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.76,0:17:53.71,sign_29945_459_Oden,text,0,0,0,,{\c&H6F6C6C&\3c&HDFE8E6&\bord2\fs30}Takoyaki
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.80,0:17:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.96,0:17:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The outside is crispy while\Nthe inside is moist and juicy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.76,0:17:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.70,0:18:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We somehow put fruit and\Ncream inside of the dough!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.12,0:18:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so sweet and delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.34,0:18:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After sampling the goods,\Nthey were all inspired.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.96,0:18:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They quickly sprang into action, developing\Ndishes based on what they just tasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.60,0:18:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Step right up, step right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.44,0:18:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a brand new menu for you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.94,0:18:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our new dish is fried meat and\Noil, which locks the flavor inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.82,0:18:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's sublime experience\Nyou can only find here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.38,0:18:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're in the mood for something sweet,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.38,0:18:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you could try a pastry filled\Nwith delicious fruit and cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.58,0:18:33.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can even choose what kind of\Nfruit you want for the filling.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.56,0:18:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, this is where\Nthe real battle starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.32,0:18:37.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.23,0:18:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just hope they can\Ntake back the customers
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.06,0:18:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who already drifted over\Nto Chain's restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.72,0:18:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm, that smells great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.88,0:18:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to go check it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.24,0:18:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chain's line is still super long.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.26,0:18:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.52,0:18:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.56,0:18:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never eaten food like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.68,0:19:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, this is way better than\Nthe stuff they serve at Chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.24,0:19:03.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.15,0:19:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Lamas and Hulemy\Nsampling the new dishes,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.12,0:19:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it looks like things are\Nturning out pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.56,0:19:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, I was wondering why the\Nrestaurant wasn't that busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.44,0:19:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all out here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.20,0:19:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you have something to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.20,0:19:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving\Nyou again. Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.52,0:19:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.88,0:19:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That serves you right, you jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.64,0:19:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, we did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.40,0:19:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armed with their new menus,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.06,0:19:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all the shops in Munami's group\Nflourish like never before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.12,0:19:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other news, a month later,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.14,0:19:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chains Restaurant made the decision to
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.84,0:19:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,completely withdraw from\NClear Flow Lake Stratum?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.28,0:19:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,due to their plummeting sales.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.78,0:19:39.03,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fs18\an2\pos(317,280)}— Out of Business —
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.24,0:19:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be honest, something\Ndoesn't feel quite right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.42,0:19:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They threw in the towel so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.54,0:19:47.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't help but think\Nthey're up to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.66,0:19:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.84,0:19:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like you've been\Nbusy again. Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.36,0:19:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I actually wanted to talk\Nto you about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.84,0:19:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think about going on\Na campaign with us after winter?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.16,0:19:59.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.07,0:20:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't even pretend\Nto think about it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.38,0:20:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I really that unpopular?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.70,0:20:06.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.92,0:20:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kick a man while he's down?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.72,0:20:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Boxo, do you treat all\Nyour regular customers this bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.34,0:20:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, we did volunteer to help\Nyou when you were stuck in a jam.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.90,0:20:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.92,0:20:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the Menagerie of Fools helping out,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.04,0:20:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Hunter Association was able to take out\Nthat gang of thieves without any issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.06,0:20:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.96,0:20:27.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.87,0:20:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean you're\Nstarting to warm up to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.74,0:20:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we'd only bring\Nyou along if Lammis agreed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.84,0:20:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's still plenty of time\Nbefore everything thaws.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.54,0:20:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do me a favor and think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.48,0:20:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My feelings are one thing, but the real\Nquestion is, what does Llamas think?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.78,0:20:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Menagerie of Fools is a\Nsuper well-known group, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.18,0:20:52.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most people would be ecstatic if they\Ngot the opportunity to accompany them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.86,0:20:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yet, you're awfully quiet, Llamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.54,0:20:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to be able to keep on fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.26,0:21:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never get any stronger if I spend\Nall my time in the safety of the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.38,0:21:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still haven't given up\Non getting revenge, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.60,0:21:11.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose it doesn't matter what I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.34,0:21:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you've found yourself\Na reliable partner now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.38,0:21:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.92,0:21:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you both, Boxxo, Hulemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.02,0:21:25.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas has been keeping this\Npain inside her this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.94,0:21:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Despite that, she's always so kind to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.92,0:21:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though I can't talk,\NI can still do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.74,0:21:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.86,0:21:38.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen flowers\Nas pretty as these.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.62,0:21:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.18,0:21:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this for me? Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.44,0:21:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.64,0:21:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.32,0:21:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks so much, Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.22,0:21:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll treasure it forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.16,0:21:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you know, Lamas?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.42,0:22:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the language of flowers, the\Npink carnation symbolizes gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.54,0:22:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.46,0:22:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.80,0:22:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,happy.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.06,0:23:40.05,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,upper left text,0,0,0,,{\pos(51,65)\fs14}Next Time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.06,0:23:40.05,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,lower right text,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs29\pos(370,298)\fscx63}The Fighting Vending Machine

